      "snippets": [
        {
          "line": 108,
          "text": "        We provide the benchmark dataset. It contains 3 parts: i) original photos, ii) document centered cropped images (used in"
        },
        {
          "line": 143,
          "text": "        Similarity (MS-SSIM) and Local Distortion (LD)."
        },
        {
          "line": 163,
          "text": "                    <a href=\"http://vision.cs.stonybrook.edu/~kema/docwarp/scan.zip\">Scans from a flatbed scanner (416MB)</a>"
        },
        {
          "line": 168,
          "text": "                    <a href=\"http://vision.cs.stonybrook.edu/~kema/docwarp/eval.zip\">Evaluation code (1MB)</a>"
        },
        {
          "line": 211,
          "text": "        The evaluation code computes both MS-SSIM and local distortion (LD). SSIM uses Matlab Image Processing toolbox. "
        },
        {
          "line": 221,
          "text": "            [2] Liu, Ce, Jenny Yuen, and Antonio Torralba. \"Sift flow: Dense correspondence "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
